WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.723
For evaluation, pretraining uses that refreshed mC4
corpus,

00:00:04.803 --> 00:00:09.526
twenty-nine trillion characters across one hundred
seven languages.

00:00:09.606 --> 00:00:14.329
The trained models are then tested on a broad suite
of tasks: TyDi QA GoldP,

00:00:14.409 --> 00:00:19.131
WMT21 multilingual translation, XNLI, XQuAD, MLQA,
and PAWS-X.

00:00:19.211 --> 00:00:23.934
Crucially,

00:00:24.014 --> 00:00:28.737
every sampling strategy is compared while sweeping
the model scale from Small all the way up to XXL,

00:00:28.817 --> 00:00:33.540
so the study can isolate whether the benefits
actually persist as the models get bigger.
